  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACCORD Fredsbyggande i Sydsudan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCORD Peacebuilding South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">De viktigaste m&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r ACCORDs &quot;Sydsudan Initiativ&quot; &#xe4;r att: fr&#xe4;mja   dialog f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad politiskt engagemang och medborgarskaplig medverkan,  st&#xf6;dja Ramverket f&#xf6;r fredsbyggande, samt att etablera ACCORDs n&#xe4;rvaro i Juba. Programmet fokuserar p&#xe5; konflikt-k&#xe4;nslig planering/           utveckling, konflikthantering/omvandling, samt fredsbyggande, med     st&#xf6;d till intressenter i regering och civilsamh&#xe4;llet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The key objectives of ACCORD&apos;s &quot;South Sudan Initiative&quot; is to:        Promote dialogue for increased political engagement and citizenship   participation; Support the peacebuilding framework; To complete the   ACCORD deployment in Juba. The programme focuses on conflict          sensitive planning/development, conflict management/transformation;   and peacebuilding, empowering stakeholders in Gov and civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
